#
# A versionCode names one build. Android refuses an update whose versionCode is
# not higher than the installed one, and Play refuses a code it has seen, so a
# second build at a spent code reaches nobody as an update and makes the code
# name two different things.
#
# Read by:
#   android/app/build.gradle.kts  assertVersionCodeUnspent: a build signed with
#                                 the release key refuses a code at or below it.
#   tool/preflight_play_upload.sh gate 4: refuses a bundle at or below it.
#
# Raise it, never lower it. It is NOT the Play upload record
# (tool/play_uploaded_version_codes.txt is), and a code below it may still be
# absent from Play.
